  "description": "A C# .NET Standard Library for the Reading Buses API (https://reading-opendata.r2p.com/), available to use in your C# console, UWP, WPF or Win Form Applications.\n\nThis includes bus services operated by Reading Buses and subsidiaries such as, Thames Valley Buses and Newbury & District Buses, and other operators within Reading.\n\nThe library supports the List of Bus Stops, Live Vehicle Positions, Live Journey Details, Stop Predictions, List of Lines, Line Patterns, Timetabled Journeys, Tracking History and the Vehicle Position History API.\n\nGet your own API Keys from: https://reading-opendata.r2p.com/api-service",
